  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Welcome to 30A Beach View Breeze, a beautifully designed three-story coastal vacation home in Inlet Beach, Florida, just minutes from Scenic Highway 30A. Thoughtfully curated for comfort, flexibility, and relaxed coastal living, this spacious retreat sleeps up to 15 guests, making it ideal for family vacations, multi-generational trips, group getaways, and extended stays. With generous sleeping arrangements, multiple living areas, private balconies, and community amenities, this home is designed to give everyone space to relax—without sacrificing time together.<br> <br>The Home | Designed for Comfort, Space & Connection (Sleeps 15)<br>This well-appointed three-story home offers both shared gathering spaces and private retreats, perfect for larger groups and longer stays.<br><br>Main Level<br>• Open-concept living area with plush seating and Smart TV<br>• Fully equipped kitchen with gas range, stainless steel appliances, wall ovens, and wine cooler<br>• Oversized island with seating for four<br>• Coffee and beverage bar<br>• Half bathroom<br>• Attached garage<br>This level is ideal for family meals, game nights, and relaxing evenings.<br><br>Second Floor<br>• Primary suite with king bed, Smart TV, and spa-style ensuite bath<br>• Bunk room with triple bunks plus a twin-over-full bunk with trundle<br>• Two additional rollaway beds<br>• Full bathroom<br>• Game room/flex space with TV, desk, balcony, board games, and card games<br><br>Third Floor<br>• King bedroom with ensuite bathroom<br>• Queen bedroom with nearby full bath<br>• Bonus living area—perfect for movie nights<br>• Full laundry room with washer, dryer, iron, and steamer<br> <br>Outdoor Living & Community Amenities<br>• Multiple private balconies<br>• Access to The Ivy community pool<br>• Peaceful residential neighborhood setting<br> <br>Complimentary Amenities & Guest Extras<br>• 4 adult beach cruiser bikes<br>• High-speed Wi-Fi throughout<br>• Smart TVs in living areas and bedrooms<br>• Luggage drop-off available upon request<br>• Early check-in or late check-out may be available as a half-day add-on<br> <br>Optional Golf Cart Rental (LSV)<br>An optional Low-Speed Vehicle (LSV) golf cart rental is available for guests age 25+. This popular add-on makes trips to the beach, dining, and exploring Scenic 30A easy and fun.<br>Booking details are provided after reservation confirmation.<br> <br>Prime Location in Inlet Beach, Florida<br>30A Beach View Breeze is located in The Ivy, a quiet residential community just off Scenic Highway 30A—close to everything, yet away from congestion and crowds.<br>Inlet Beach is often called the Gateway to 30A, offering wider, less crowded beaches and easier access than many neighboring communities.<br><br>Guests love Inlet Beach for:<br>• Sugar-white sand beaches<br>• Emerald Gulf waters<br>• Relaxed, uncrowded atmosphere<br>• Large public beach access points<br>It is home to the largest public beach access in Walton County, making beach days simple—even during peak season.<br> <br>Easy Beach Access<br>The main public Inlet Beach access is approximately 0.4 miles from the home.<br>Ways to get there:<br>• Walk in about 8–10 minutes<br>• Bike using the provided beach cruisers<br>• Optional golf cart rental<br>With its wide shoreline and open layout, Inlet Beach is perfect for families, couples, and groups who want space to spread out.<br> <br>Between Lake Powell & the Gulf<br>One of the most unique aspects of this location is its proximity to Lake Powell, one of Florida’s rare coastal dune lakes.<br>Just minutes away, guests can enjoy:<br>• Kayaking and paddleboarding<br>• Fishing and wildlife viewing<br>• Calm water activities ideal for children<br>Many guests love alternating between Gulf beach days and peaceful afternoons on the lake.<br> <br>Near Camp Helen State Park & Natural Attractions<br>Nearby Camp Helen State Park is one of the Emerald Coast’s most treasured natural destinations, where Lake Powell meets the Gulf.<br>Here you’ll find:<br>• Scenic hiking and walking trails<br>• Picnic areas and shaded green spaces<br>• Historic structures dating back to the early 1900s<br>• Birdwatching and photography<br>Additional nearby parks include Grayton Beach State Park, Topsail Hill Preserve State Park, and Eden Gardens State Park.<br> <br>Central to 30A’s Most Popular Communities<br>From this home, you’re perfectly positioned to explore:<br>• Rosemary Beach<br>• Alys Beach<br>• Seaside<br>• WaterColor<br>• 30Avenue (walkable dining and shopping)<br>The Timpoochee Trail, an 18.6-mile paved bike path, runs the length of Scenic 30A. A nearby underpass beneath Highway 98 makes crossing safe and easy.<br> <br>Dining, Shopping & Entertainment Nearby<br>Guests love the proximity to:<br>• Shades Bar & Grill<br>• Big Bad Breakfast<br>• Cuvee 30A<br>• Amici Italian Kitchen<br>• Amigos Mexican Kitchen<br>• Paradis<br>• Pescado Rooftop Bar<br>• La Crema Tapas & Chocolate<br>Shopping includes 30Avenue, Rosemary Beach and Alys Beach boutiques, Seaside town center, Silver Sands Premium Outlets, and Pier Park.<br> <br>Things to Do Near 30A Beach View Breeze<br>• Beach days at Inlet Beach<br>• Snorkeling South Walton artificial reefs<br>• Paddleboarding and kayaking on Lake Powell<br>• Fishing charters and Shell Island boat tours<br>• Parasailing and jet skiing<br>• Golf at Camp Creek Golf Club<br>• Biking or running the Timpoochee Trail<br> <br>Ideal For<br>This home is perfect for:<br>• Families with children<br>• Multi-generational vacations<br>• Larger groups or multiple families<br>• Snowbirds and extended stays<br>• Guests seeking a peaceful coastal setting with easy access to town<br> <br>Your Ideal 30A Home Base<br>Inlet Beach is known for its wide beaches, laid-back atmosphere, and easy access to everything Scenic 30A has to offer. At 30A Beach View Breeze, you’ll enjoy a spacious, thoughtfully designed home close to beaches, dune lakes, state parks, dining, and shopping—without sacrificing tranquility.<br>Whether you’re here for beach mornings, lake afternoons, outdoor adventures, or total relaxation, this is the perfect place to call home during your 30A getaway.<br> <br>Proudly managed by 30A Beach Escapes, LLC<br>STR# 116092 | TDT# 290208",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
